 "notes": [
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0603.mbb#0.55",
   "note": "Leader-variant block 0.49-0.63 follows the script's Pt_Chara_Check chain 9,10,8,6,7,15,14,13,12,11,5,4,3,2,1: 0.55 Mebius, 0.56 Taro, 0.57 Seven, 0.58 Ultraman, 0.59 OOO, 0.60 W (identical text, identical English), 0.61 Den-O (Momotaros), 0.62 RX, 0.63 Rider 1 (script calls TextIdOffset+48+14 for Rider 1 = key 0.63). 'Next is the right' read as the next wave of Virgos appearing on the right, per the Zeta variant 0.53 ('reinforcements from the right?!') in the previous slice."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0603.mbb#0.61",
   "note": "Momotaros variant (rough 'yossha'): 'Hell yeah!!'."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0603.mbb#0.66",
   "note": "Rider 1 (TextIdOffset+65/66/67). Next wave on the left; a beam from an unseen Virgo then hits him (0.67 'where from', 0.68 'behind'). Rows 0.69-0.110 are the other 14 leaders' identical copies of the same three lines; order not needed since text is identical. Subject 'it' (the shot) restored in 0.67."
  },
  {
   "key": "MainEventMess0603.mbb#0.112",
   "note": "Pairs 0.112-0.141 are leader variants in chain order (Rider 1 = 0.140/0.141 per TextIdOffset+111+28). All pairs in this slice identical: shot from the side, then a grunt."
  }
 ],
 "report": "80/80 rows. Highly repetitive leader-variant blocks; identical Japanese given identical English. Interpreted 'next is the right/left' as enemy waves appearing on that side (supported by the Zeta variant in story_109). No new names."
